<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-unknown> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Manifestation mode not recorded or not known."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#uniformTitle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The standardized title for this intellectual work, independent of how the title may appear on any specific manuscript or in any particular catalog. Use the form established by the relevant authority file: LCNAF, HAF (HMML Authority File), DBMNT, or community convention. Language-tagged. A single work may have multiple uniform title assertions in different languages or from different authority sources."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-possession> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationMode> .
