<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-manifestation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Iroko Historical Society" .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#physicalSupport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The material substrate of the manuscript object. Range: iroko:PhysicalSupportScheme. Covers parchment, paper, papyrus, stone, ostracon, textile, metal, wood, clay, and other carriers. Values drawn from the controlled vocabulary used by vHMML and comparable manuscript cataloging projects."@en .
