<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#TextContent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An abstract intellectual work — a text as a specific composition, title, or discrete textual unit — independent of its physical carrier. Equivalent to the FRBR Work level and to the Contents level in the vHMML three-tier hierarchy. Distinct from iroko:ManuscriptObject (the physical carrier) and from iroko:NarrativeVariant (a specific transcribed or performed telling). A single iroko:TextContent may be carried by multiple ManuscriptObjects across different repositories or copies. Properties cover language, script, genre, and uniform title. Subclass of iroko:SacredEntity."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#physicalSupport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManuscriptObject> .
