<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-unknown> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Unknown"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-dream> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-manifestation> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-auditory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Auditory"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#carriersText> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a ManuscriptObject to an iroko:TextContent it physically carries. One ManuscriptObject may carry multiple TextContent instances — a codex may contain several distinct works. Inverse of iroko:carriedBy."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationModeScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-divination> .
