<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Medium> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Medium"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#support-other> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Physical support type not covered by existing concepts. Use skos:scopeNote on the instance to describe the specific material."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#support-parchment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Animal skin prepared as a writing surface. Used extensively in Ethiopian, Nubian, and European medieval manuscript traditions."@en .
