<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#textScript> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The script or writing system of the text content. Examples: Latin, Arabic, Ge'ez (Ethiopic), Greek, Old Nubian (Coptic-based), Hebrew, Syriac. Use ISO 15924 four-letter script codes where available. Multiple scripts may be present in a single text; record all."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-dream> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationMode> .
